# Generated transporters for the symmetric-square action on the internal points

This file is generated by `generate_transporter_data.py`.  The normalized invertible
two-by-two matrices act on the 78 internal points of the standard conic over `ZMod 13`
through their symmetric square.  That action is transitive on the internal points and on
each of the six classes of ordered distinct pairs cut out by the normalized polar
invariant.  The lists below choose, for each point and for each ordered distinct pair, the
index of one matrix realizing the corresponding transport from the base point or from the
displayed representative of the class.  Lean checks each chosen index against the action
it is claimed to realize; the lists carry no trust of their own, and a wrong entry makes
the check fail rather than making a false statement provable.
-/

